<!-- Generated file - do not edit by hand. The layout comes from one profile
     per size; the compact one is the same window at about three quarters the
     size. Five buttons, each with an icon shown for the "Icons" and "Icons
     and text" styles; dialog.py fills in the labels and clears the ones a
     style does not show. -->
